      "ImageDescription": {
        "value": "Any trip to Bakersfield requires a side-trip to the Tehachapi Loop near Keane.  It was a bit stormy, so the light was really nice.\nA BNSF hopper car train swings around the Tehachapi Loop in the dramatic clouds and sunlight and disappears into the Tunnel 9; passing under itself and leaving the loop.  Helper locomotives are at the end of the consist and in the middle (barely visible where the train goes behind the cone-shaped hill to the right of the frame).",
